sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Pool as DatabasePool
    participant Conn as Connection
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    Note over App,PG: Normal Query Flow

    App->>Pool: query(sql, params)
    Pool->>Pool: Check not shutting down
    Pool->>Conn: Acquire from pool

    alt Connection available
        Conn-->>Pool: Connection ready
    else Pool saturated
        Note over Pool: Wait in queue
        Conn-->>Pool: Connection ready (after wait)
    end

    Pool->>PG: Execute query
    PG-->>Pool: Result
    Pool->>Pool: Track metrics<br/>(duration, count)
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'query' event
    Pool-->>App: Return result
    Pool->>Conn: Return to idle pool

    Note over App,PG: Transaction Flow

    App->>Pool: getClient()
    Pool->>Conn: Acquire connection
    Pool->>Pool: Track checkout time
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'clientAcquired'
    Conn-->>App: Client

    App->>Conn: query('BEGIN')
    Conn->>PG: BEGIN
    PG-->>Conn: OK

    App->>Conn: query('UPDATE ...')
    Conn->>PG: UPDATE
    PG-->>Conn: OK

    App->>Conn: query('COMMIT')
    Conn->>PG: COMMIT
    PG-->>Conn: OK

    App->>Conn: release()
    Conn->>Pool: Return to pool
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'clientReleased'
    Pool->>Conn: Add to idle connections

    Note over App,PG: Error Handling

    App->>Pool: query(invalid_sql)
    Pool->>PG: Execute query
    PG-->>Pool: Error
    Pool->>Pool: Increment error count
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'error' event
    Pool-->>App: Throw error
    Pool->>Conn: Return to idle pool

    Note over App,PG: Graceful Shutdown

    App->>Pool: gracefulShutdown(30000)
    Pool->>Pool: Set isShuttingDown = true
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'shuttingDown'

    loop Wait for active clients (max 30s)
        Pool->>Pool: Check activeClients.size
        alt All clients released
            Note over Pool: Proceed to close
        else Timeout exceeded
            Pool->>Conn: Force release clients
            Pool->>Pool: Emit 'forcedClientRelease'
        end
    end

    Pool->>Conn: Close all connections
    Conn->>PG: Close
    Pool->>Pool: Emit 'shutdown' event
    Pool-->>App: Shutdown complete
